Z||000011||deceler8||03-07-2000||10:21 AM||||I really like Girl Scout cookies but don't eat them anymore...what I did last year was tell the little girl that came to the door that I'd pay her for five boxes but that she could keep the cookies.<P>You could tell by the look in her eyes that she didn't know what to do as I had deviated from the script. So she goes out to the car and talks to Mom for a few minutes and then Mom comes to the door. Mom didn't know what to do so I took the damn cookies and had my wife take them to work.<P>They must actually teach that honesty crap in Girl Scouts (LOL).||||reg||1
